---
// Move 2 — every file wears a badge (frontmatter), like a stamp on a passport.
---
<figure class="figure">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 720 320" role="img" aria-label="A document with frontmatter, carrying a big rubber stamp that reads: not a promise.">
    <g class="sv">
      <!-- the document -->
      <g transform="translate(150 24)">
        <rect class="sv-card" width="300" height="272" rx="12" />
        <text class="sv-mono" x="24" y="38">---</text>
        <text class="sv-mono" x="24" y="62">title: <tspan class="sv-pine">Recurring Invoices</tspan></text>
        <text class="sv-mono" x="24" y="86">kind: <tspan class="sv-rust-t">reference</tspan></text>
        <text class="sv-mono" x="24" y="110">status: <tspan class="sv-rust-t">reference</tspan></text>
        <text class="sv-mono" x="24" y="134">updated: <tspan class="sv-pine">2026-05-29</tspan></text>
        <text class="sv-mono" x="24" y="158">---</text>
        <line class="sv-line" x1="24" y1="186" x2="270" y2="186" />
        <line class="sv-line" x1="24" y1="208" x2="250" y2="208" />
        <line class="sv-line" x1="24" y1="230" x2="264" y2="230" />
        <line class="sv-line" x1="24" y1="252" x2="180" y2="252" />
      </g>

      <!-- the stamp -->
      <g transform="translate(415 150) rotate(-9)">
        <rect class="sv-stamp" width="250" height="86" rx="10" />
        <text class="sv-stamp-text" x="125" y="38" text-anchor="middle">NOT A PROMISE</text>
        <text class="sv-stamp-sub" x="125" y="64" text-anchor="middle">status: reference</text>
      </g>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    Like the label on a medicine bottle: the pills all look alike — the label is what keeps you
    safe. Five statuses, machine-readable, checked on every push.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
